========================================================================
  alpha_c = 3 alpha        = 0.021892058
  k = ln(1+pi/2a_c)/pi     = 1.364611915   (booked 1.36461191)
  L = 4 pi k / alpha_c     = 783.3078  cells per side
  N = L^3                  = 4.80615e+08
  A_s = (alpha_c/4 pi k)^3 = 2.080668e-09

(1) WHAT THE -0.35% ACTUALLY MEASURES
  frozen A_s (yaml:91)             = 2.088058e-09
  closed form at k_joint = 1.363  = 2.088058e-09
    -> the frozen value IS the closed form at the joint k, to 0.0000%
  k implied by the frozen value    = 1.3630000
  A_s(k_closed) / A_s(k_joint) - 1 = -0.3539 %   [booked -0.35%]
  pure k effect 3*ln(k_joint/k_cf) = -0.3546 %
  => the residual is the k-determination spread, NOT the count C.

(2) THE HONEST DATA CONFRONTATION
  Planck A_s (ledger:801)  = 2.1000e-09 +/- 1.4%
  closed form vs it        = -0.921 % = -0.66 sigma
  C_required = A_meas/A_cf = 1.00929 +/- 0.014

(3) MECHANIZATION ATTEMPT — C = R^2 (k_* l_p)^3 / (2 pi^2)
  conformal (w = 1/3) transfer R = 1/(3(1+w)) = 0.25
  pivot-volume convention          C at R=1/4   R needed for C=1
  l_p = 2 pi / k_*  (wavelength)     0.785398            0.28209
  l_p = pi / k_*    (half-wave)      0.098175            0.79788
  l_p = 1 / k_*     (inverse k)      0.003166            4.44288
  => no convention returns C = 1 at the corpus's own transfer; the three
     readings span a factor of ~250. C hides the convention AND R.

(4) WHAT THE CLOSED FORM IS EQUIVALENT TO (the forward target, re-typed 2026-07-20)
  freeze-out ratio k_* xi required at R = 1: 3.45020e-03 = 1/289.8 of k_*^-1
  i.e. the census must lock cells ~290x below the mode's own scale.
  NOT a Kibble-Zurek freeze-out ratio: P_zeta = R^2 xi^3 carries no k, so one
  frozen comoving xi is white noise (Delta^2 ~ k^3, n_s = 4). Scale invariance
  needs xi(k) ~ 1/k -- a SCALING length holding a fixed fraction of the horizon.
  The basement owes a mechanism of that type before it owes the number.

(5) THE 6i JOINT'S REAL REQUIREMENT
  3 alpha(0)                     A_s = 2.0807e-09   C needed = 1.0036
  3 alpha(M_Z) [1/127.95]        A_s = 2.6810e-09   C needed = 0.7788
  3 alpha extrapolated [1/106]   A_s = 5.3948e-09   C needed = 0.3871
